{"seq":63,"slug":"structured-output-constrained-decoding","title":"结构化输出与约束解码","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding","rating":{"composite":4.33,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"结构化输出与约束解码-总览\">结构化输出与约束解码·总览</h1><p>把大模型的输出接到一段真实的代码里，第一个崩掉的往往不是模型的&quot;智力&quot;，而是格式：你要一个 JSON，它在前面礼貌地写了一句&quot;好的，下面是结果&quot;；你要一个枚举值，它自作主张造了个同义词；你在批处理一万条数据，第 9712 条少了一个右花括号，整条流水线停摆。结构化输出（structured output）与约束解码（constrained decoding）这门技术，正是为了让模型产出<strong>可机读、可解析、100% 合规</strong>的结构——不是靠事后正则修补，而是在解码的每一步就掐断所有不合法的 token。</p>\n<p>本 hub 沿一条清晰的递进展开。<strong>基础</strong>章回答&quot;为什么&quot;与&quot;是什么&quot;：为什么提示里写&quot;只返回 JSON&quot;远远不够、约束解码在采样循环里到底插了哪一脚、以及业界分裂出的两条技术路线（正则/文法 vs JSON Schema）各自的取舍。<strong>机制</strong>章下沉到底层实现：正则如何编译成有限状态机并在词表上算出 logit 掩码、上下文无关文法如何用下推自动机与 Earley 解析器突破正则的表达力上限、以及一份 JSON Schema 怎样被翻译成可执行的约束。<strong>系统</strong>章把单点机制装进真实引擎：工具调用与函数调用如何借结构化输出落地、跳跃解码与合并解码如何把约束从&quot;零成本&quot;做到&quot;负成本&quot;（反而更快）、以及 Outlines / XGrammar / llguidance 三家与 vLLM / SGLang 的格局。<strong>实践</strong>章收束到工程判断：什么时候该用提示、什么时候必须上硬约束、约束带来的&quot;对齐税&quot;与推理退化如何规避、以及怎样科学地评测一套结构化输出方案。</p>\n<p>四条主线层层递进：动机划定了问题边界，机制给出了可验证的原理，系统把原理变成可调用的引擎，实践则告诉你在权衡里如何落子。读完你应当能回答两个核心问题——&quot;这个场景该不该约束&quot;，以及&quot;约束之后准确率掉了，根因在哪、怎么救&quot;。</p>\n<p>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界要先说清。约束解码运行在 serving 引擎的采样阶段，但本 hub 不讲连续批处理、PagedAttention、KV cache 这些通用 serving 机制，那些归 <a href=\"../llm-serving-inference-systems/\">LLM 服务与推理系统</a>；本 hub 只关心&quot;如何在采样这一步插入约束&quot;。结构化输出是工具调用的底层保障，但 agent 的规划、记忆、多智能体编排归 <a href=\"../ai-agent-frameworks/\">AI agent 框架</a> 与 <a href=\"../ai-agent-development/\">AI agent 开发</a>；本 hub 只讲&quot;函数参数如何被强制成合法 schema&quot;。投机解码作为一种加速手段在 serving hub 有完整篇章，本 hub 只讲它与约束的<strong>交互</strong>。提示工程层面的 JSON 引导技巧归 <a href=\"../prompt-engineering/\">提示工程</a>，本 hub 把它作为&quot;约束的对立面&quot;来对照。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径分三类读者。<strong>只想把 JSON 拿稳的应用开发者</strong>：读 1/1、3/1（工具调用）、4/1（提示还是约束），再扫一眼 4/2 的失效模式即可上手。<strong>要在自建 serving 上集成约束的基础设施工程师</strong>：从 2/1 → 2/2 → 2/3 打通机制，再读 3/2、3/3 选型与调优。<strong>做研究或评测的同学</strong>：重点在 2/2（文法理论）、4/2（对齐税）、4/3（评测基准）。前置知识方面，你需要理解 LLM 的自回归采样与 token 化的基本概念（可回看 <a href=\"../llm-fundamentals/\">LLM 基础</a>），机制章涉及正则、有限状态机、上下文无关文法等形式语言基础，没接触过也能跟下来，但补一点会读得更顺。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-structured-output","title":"为何需要结构化输出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/foundations/why-structured-output"},{"seq":2,"slug":"constrained-decoding-basics","title":"约束解码基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/foundations/constrained-decoding-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"grammar-vs-schema","title":"语法与模式两条路线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/foundations/grammar-vs-schema"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mechanisms","title":"机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/mechanisms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logit-masking-fsm","title":"logit 掩码与有限状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/mechanisms/logit-masking-fsm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cfg-grammar-constraints","title":"上下文无关文法约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/mechanisms/cfg-grammar-constraints"},{"seq":3,"slug":"json-schema-enforcement","title":"JSON Schema 强制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/mechanisms/json-schema-enforcement"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tool-use-function-calling","title":"工具调用与函数调用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/systems/tool-use-function-calling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"speculative-jump-decoding","title":"跳跃与加速解码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/systems/speculative-jump-decoding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"library-landscape","title":"库与引擎格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/systems/library-landscape"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prompt-vs-constraint","title":"提示工程与约束的边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/practice/prompt-vs-constraint"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reliability-failure-modes","title":"可靠性与失效模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/practice/reliability-failure-modes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-structured","title":"结构化输出评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/structured-output-constrained-decoding/practice/evaluation-structured"}]}]}